# Web UI (`apps/web`)

- Next.js App Router under `app/`; shared UI in `components/`, API helpers in `lib/`.
- Talks to Worker A via `NEXT_PUBLIC_CORE_WORKER_URL`; optional billing via `NEXT_PUBLIC_BILLING_WORKER_URL`.
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_ALLOW_MOCK_UNLOCK` is staging/local demo only — never treat as production auth.
- Prefer existing page patterns under `app/itineraries/` over new layout systems.
- No Stripe secret usage in the browser or Pages functions in this repo.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/web-ui/SKILL.md`.
